# Whitelist-based .gitignore
# Assumes this repo root may also be (or be merged into) an active OC4 install.
# Everything is ignored by default; only the files we own are tracked.

# Step 1: ignore everything
*

# Step 2: un-ignore the files we own
!.gitignore
!CLAUDE.md

# GitHub Actions. Git will not descend into an ignored directory, so every
# level needs its own un-ignore rule — dropping any one of these three makes
# the workflow files invisible to `git add` and CI silently never runs.
!.github/
!.github/workflows/
!.github/workflows/**

# Payflex_output (only the script, not any built zips)
!Payflex_output/
!Payflex_output/create_zip.sh

# Extension source files
!extension/
!extension/payflex/
!extension/payflex/**
